  "solution": {
    "text": "The terminal alkyl group is partially oxidised to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>CHO</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> group by Etard reaction by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CrO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>CCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math><br />So, the given is Etard reduction",
